+/// [`create_now`], kept by the device where `SWEET_M2V_PASS_CACHE` is on (0125, [`KeptFinal`]):
+/// the kept pass where it has one, else one made now and kept from now on, while it keeps fewer
+/// than [`KEPT_FINAL`]. A kept pass is destroyed with its device, not its holders.
+fn create(
+    device: &Device,
+    shape: &PassShape,
